      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">This is a close combat weapon with the Haywire special rule. Additionally, any model which takes an unsaved wound from this weapon and survives, is reduced to Initiative 1 until the beginning of your next turn.</characteristic>
