    <profile name="Mindscrambler Grenades" id="680d-c8f5-f8a4-6931" hidden="false" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">These grenades can be used as normal to attack vehicles. Roll a D6 for each hit scored to determine the effect on the target vehicle.


1 No effect


2-5 Glancing Hit


6 Penetrating Hit</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Phase Taser" id="d0ce-9491-ba13-0e7a" hidden="false" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">When rolling to hit, any roll of a 6 generates two additional hits on the enemy. Additionally, any model that suffers one or more unsaved Wounds from this weapon must immediately pass an Initiative test or suffer Instant Death.</characteristic>
